# ============================================================================
# SAWO.COM 301 REDIRECTS — Cloudflare Pages format
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# HOW TO USE:
#   Copy this file, as-is, to  frontend/public/_redirects
#   Cloudflare Pages auto-discovers a file named exactly `_redirects` in the
#   build output root (CRA copies everything in public/ into build/ unchanged,
#   so putting it in public/ is sufficient — no build step needed for this).
#   Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
#   Syntax per line:  <source>  <destination>  <status>
#   Cloudflare reads these top-to-bottom and applies the FIRST match — order
#   matters. All entries below are 301 (permanent), which is what preserves
#   search-ranking signal from the old WordPress URLs. Do not change any of
#   these to 302 later as a "quick fix."
#
# NOTE ON TRANSLATIONS: this file only contains English-site redirects. The
# /fi and /de translated site (frontend-next) is DEFERRED — see the note in
# GO-LIVE-INSTRUCTIONS.md section 1. No /fi or /de rewrite rules are included
# here; add them back when translations resume.
#
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
